---
// HeroContenido.astro — Columna editorial de portada
---

<div class="hero-content">
  <div class="kicker-wrap">
    <span class="kicker-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="kicker-text">PARA ALMACENES HORTOFRUTÍCOLAS</span>
  </div>

  <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero-title">
    Todos tus DeCA del día, sin ir albarán por albarán.
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-description">
    Importas tus albaranes o tus cartas de porte, pones una matrícula por camión y emites todos los DeCA de cada transportista con un botón. Sin cambiar de ERP.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary hero-btn-primary">
      <span>Pruébalo gratis un mes</span>
      <svg class="btn-arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
        <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <button
      type="button"
      id="open-video-modal"
      class="btn btn-secondary hero-btn-secondary"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      aria-controls="hero-video-modal"
    >
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <polygon points="6 4 20 12 6 20 6 4"></polygon>
      </svg>
      <span>Ver cómo funciona</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="hero-footnote">
    Primer mes gratis · Te lo dejamos configurado · Datos en la UE
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .kicker-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .kicker-line {
    width: 24px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    border-radius: 1px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .kicker-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.125rem, 3.6vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-footnote {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .hero-btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    color: var(--palette-white);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.22);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .hero-btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-brand-hover, var(--palette-emerald-800));
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.32);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .btn-arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .hero-btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .hero-btn-secondary {
    background-color: var(--palette-white);
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong, var(--palette-slate-300));
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }

  .hero-btn-secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface-subtle, var(--palette-slate-100));
    border-color: var(--palette-slate-400);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 1.95rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-btn-primary:hover,
    .hero-btn-secondary:hover,
    .btn-arrow {
      transform: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
